sequenceDiagram
    participant Device as IoT Device<br/>(MCU + TPM)
    participant Factory as Manufacturer<br/>(Secure Facility)
    participant Owner as Owner/Operator<br/>(Enterprise)
    participant Registry as DID Registry<br/>(Public Ledger)

    Note over Device, Factory: Manufacturing Phase
    
    Factory->>Device: 1. Inject Identity Key (EK)
    Device->>Factory: 2. Return Public EK
    Factory->>Registry: 3. Register Reference (SerialNumber -> PubKey)
    
    Note over Device, Owner: Onboarding Phase
    
    Owner->>Device: 4. Power On & Connect
    Device->>Device: 5. Generate Attestation Key (AK)
    Device->>Owner: 6. Send Attestation (Quote(AK) signed by EK)
    
    Owner->>Registry: 7. Verify EK Trust Chain
    Registry-->>Owner: Valid Manufacturer
    
    Owner->>Device: 8. Issue Root PoA (Bind AK to Owner DID)
    Device->>Device: 9. Store PoA in Secure Flash
    
    Note right of Device: Device is now<br/>Authorized Agent
